{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e7bd4632-eb7a-8ff1-8020-94d7777ad840",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:00:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning, well, almost afternoon. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about a pile of stuff left on the curb at 230 Bridge Street, down in the Point. It's not mine, and I want to know who's supposed to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:58:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of stuff are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk waste. A mattress, a couple of chairs, some boxes, a broken dresser. The landlord put it all out there after a tenant moved out this weekend. Sunday morning, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's a rental next door, or is it your building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next door, but the pile is half in front of my place. So, how do I know it's not going to just sit there for two weeks? Because that's what I'm worried it'll do. Not worried, I mean, that's what I expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Bulk items usually need to be set up for a special pickup. They don't get taken with regular trash automatically. So if the landlord didn't arrange it, it may not get picked up on your regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so why would it not get picked up? It's on the curb. That's where the trash goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Regular trash, yes. Large items like mattresses and furniture are handled differently. The crew can leave them behind if they weren't scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what happens to the landlord? Does somebody tell him? Or does he just get away with it, per favore, no, sorry, I'm learning Italian, it slips out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no problem. I can note the address and the complaint. Someone from the department can follow up with the owner about getting it removed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you say that again? Who follows up, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a report with the address and what's out there, and it goes to a supervisor here. They decide on the next step with the property owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then I'd like the supervisor to call me back. Can you do that? I want to hear it from them, not just assume."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll ask for a callback. What number is best?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0169. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. And the name is Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Jorge Resendes, 230 Bridge Street, bulk furniture and a mattress left at the curb by the landlord after a move-out. Supervisor to call you back. Did I get all of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's everything. When should I expect the call? Today, tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise an exact time, but most likely today or tomorrow. If they miss you, they'll leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Grazie. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
